{"updated":"2026-09-20T19:10:53.975Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Sister of Pakistan's ex-PM Imran Khan arrested. Elsewhere, how will Saudi Arabia deal with the Houthis?. And German Chancellor Merz calls state election a 'disaster' for his party but vows to stay on. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.5 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 0.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 49 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.4 near 49 km NNE of Kainantu, Papua New Guinea. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.15,0.2,0.23,0.29,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.46,0.51,0.55,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.69,0.81,0.91,1.06,1.33,1.45,1.5,1.53,1.56,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.67,1.72,1.76,1.82,1.89,1.94,1.96,2.01,2.06,2.09,2.13,2.18,2.23,2.28,2.31,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.54,2.6,2.67,2.74,2.86,2.95,3.1,3.12,3.17,3.19,3.25,3.29,3.34,3.46,3.54,3.6,3.67,3.71,3.77,3.82,3.87,3.91,3.94,3.97,4.02,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.13,4.18,4.26,4.32,4.39,4.45,4.5,4.55,4.59,4.64,4.67,4.72,4.84,4.97,5.14,5.75,5.83,5.92,5.98,6.03,6.08,6.12,6.18,6.21,6.24,6.29,6.34,6.43,6.49,6.58,6.63,6.71,6.86,6.9,6.94,6.98,7.06,7.21,7.29,7.37,7.43,7.75,7.85,7.94,8.03,8.12,8.21,8.26,8.34,8.38,8.5,8.57,8.64,8.71,8.77,8.82,8.87,8.94,9.01,9.09,9.21,9.29,9.4,9.91,10.03,10.09,10.15,10.21,10.25,10.31,10.36,10.41,10.53,10.58,10.63,10.7,10.76,10.8,10.83,10.86,10.91,10.96,10.99,11.05,11.1,11.18,11.24,11.3,11.37,11.42,11.48,11.55,11.67,11.74,11.82,11.89,11.98,12.03,12.11,12.17,12.22,12.28,12.31,12.34,12.36,12.4,12.43,12.46,12.48,12.5,12.56,12.61,12.67,12.72,12.81,12.85,12.97,13.1,13.21,13.3,13.75,13.82,13.86,13.9,13.97,14.03,14.11,14.16,14.22,14.27,14.31,14.36,14.4,14.4